# Ignore everything
*

# But not these files...
!.gitignore
!pdf2anki/*
!pdf2anki/text2anki/*
!dist/*
!setup.py
!test.py
!README.md
!LICENSE
!MANIFEST.in
!NOTICE
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!BUILD.md
!CROPPING.md
!JUDGE.md
!DEV_GENANKI_FEATURES.md
!FAQ.md
!tests/*
!SUPERLAZYMODE_PLAN.md
# etc...


# ...even if they are in subdirectories
!*/

# Ignore everything in the .venv directory
.venv/*
pdf2anki/allfiles.txt
allfiles.txt

# --- benchmarks -------------------------------------------------------------
# Harness and report are versioned...
!benchmarks/**/scripts/*
!benchmarks/**/openrouter_models_*.json
# (README.md is already allowed above, at any depth)

# ...but NEVER the corpus a benchmark was run against, unless it is provably
# copyright-free. This repo is PUBLIC. Rendered pages and OCR results are the
# source material -- a transcription is the same content in another form, not a
# neutral measurement artifact. Runs against third-party material (lecture
# slides, exercise sheets, papers) stay local.
# A corpus that is self-generated or public-domain may be allowlisted
# explicitly, per directory, with a note saying where it came from.
benchmarks/**/pages/
benchmarks/**/results/
benchmarks/**/logs/
benchmarks/**/ground_truth.json
benchmarks/**/page_map.json

# Reviewed exception: ocr_model_selection/ is drawn from scratch by
# scripts/make_corpus.py -- no third-party material, see its CORPUS.md.
# A directory must be re-included before anything inside it can be.
!benchmarks/ocr_model_selection/corpus/
!benchmarks/ocr_model_selection/corpus/*
!benchmarks/ocr_model_selection/pages/
!benchmarks/ocr_model_selection/pages/*
!benchmarks/ocr_model_selection/results/
!benchmarks/ocr_model_selection/results/*
!benchmarks/ocr_model_selection/CORPUS.md
